ersonal favorite \"hidden gem\" in the new software.\nIf you've ever needed to fix a typo or edit a paragraph on your iPhone, you're going to love this.\nSimply long-press on the iPhone's space bar. Then you'll get a cursor you can move anywhere by dragging your finger.\nYou kind of have to see it to believe it.\nThis feature was actually first made available for the iPhone 6S, since that was the first phone with \"Force Touch\" (now \"3D Touch\"), but iOS 12 makes this functionality available on devices that lack 3D Touch, including older iPhones like the iPhone 5S, and the new iPhone XR coming in October. It also works on the iPad for the first time too.\nCheck it out:\nSEE ALSO:& How to download iOS 12, Apple's big new iPhone update\n Why TV speakers suck", "external_links": ["http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=bcOpcFrp8Mo", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=Y6FBh3AEXws:sWTqNxFeFM0:gIN9vFwOqvQ", "https://www.businessinsider.com/apple-ios-12-easter-egg-quick-edit-iphone-text-2018-9#comments", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=Y6FBh3AEXws:sWTqNxFeFM0:qj6IDK7rITs", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=Y6FBh3AEXws:sWTqNxFeFM0:yIl2AUoC8zA", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=Y6FBh3AEXws:sWTqNxFeFM0:bcOpcFrp8Mo", "http://feedproxy.google.com/~r/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider/~3/Y6FBh3AEXws/apple-ios-12-easter-egg-quick-edit-iphone-text-2018-9", "https://www.businessinsider.com/apple-ios-12-walkthrough-biggest-new-iphone-features-beta-2018-6", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=7Q72WNTAKBA", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=QXVau8BzmBE", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=cGdyc7Q-1BI", "https://www.businessinsider.com/w